From e506f5606a0e348ab52bd1edd29ff73112f2e6c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DoubleGate <parobek@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:33:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] [UPSTREAM] notifications: Gotify sink

Add an optional Gotify sink: when `gotify_url` is set, each notification is
POSTed to `<gotify_url>/message` as Gotify JSON {title, message, priority}
with the application token in the `X-Gotify-Key` header, independently of the
other sinks. Priority is derived from the notification type (Warning 8,
LowBattery 5, Update 2).

`gotify_token` is a secret: redacted from `GET /api/config` and preserved
across a config write that omits it, dropped if `gotify_url` changes (the same
unauthenticated-API protection as ntfy_auth). The `resolve_ntfy_auth` helper
is generalized to `resolve_endpoint_secret` and reused for both.

Tests: Gotify JSON body, priority and X-Gotify-Key header; gotify_token
redaction.

Ref: Orbic-Rayhunter T-OR-049.
Signed-off-by: DoubleGate <parobek@gmail.com>
